# Net 10 on the office's calendar of the module lib, named by `@lib/…`. That calendar reads the
# closed days of base, which this module does not require: they are read as `@lib/@base/…`.
dates net10 v1
description "Net 10: due ten days after the invoice date, moved to the next day the office is open"
use calendar "@lib/calendars/office.cal"

inputs
  invoice_date : date  range >=2026-01-01 <=2027-11-30

date due = invoice_date
  + 10 days
  roll following

claims
  due_on_an_open_day      : due is open
  later_invoice_later_due : due is monotonic

examples
| invoice_date | -> due     |
| 2026-12-15   | 2026-12-29 |
| 2026-04-06   | 2026-04-16 |
